<section class="philosophy-section" id="philosophy">
  <div class="container philosophy-container">
    <span class="section-badge">A Dual Journey</span>
    <h3 class="philosophy-quote">
      "Exploring the world without checking in with yourself is just moving. Sitting still without understanding the world around you is just isolation. As a slow traveller and traditional Indian spiritual seeker, I write at the intersection of both—navigating mountain trails and inner landscapes to find grounding in a chaotic world."
    </h3>
    <span class="philosophy-author">Akhi</span>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .philosophy-section {
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem;
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
    border-bottom: var(--border-thin);
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    transition: background-color 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);
  }

  .philosophy-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .section-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-editorial);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    transition: color 0.6s ease;
  }

  .philosophy-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-editorial);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.85rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    transition: color 0.6s ease;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .philosophy-quote {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
    }
  }

  .philosophy-author {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    opacity: 0.6;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
</style>
